  "Question": "Roll 2 fair dice simultaneously. What is the probability that the sum of the numbers rolled is 7? (Express the result as a fraction in simplest form.)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "1/6",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Using a table gives \\(6\\times6=36\\) equally likely outcomes. The outcomes with a sum of 7 are \\((1,6)\\), \\((2,5)\\), \\((3,4)\\), \\((4,3)\\), \\((5,2)\\), and \\((6,1)\\), giving 6 outcomes. The probability is \\(6/36=1/6\\).",
